# committed with an empty signingConfigs array; fill it in locally through
# DevEco Studio (Project Structure > Signing Configs) if you want a locally
# signed HAP. The ArkDeck path does not need one — it signs the unsigned HAP
# through workspace.sign-openharmony-hap@1.
